# What must never reach a build context, and what simply has no business
# being there.
#
# The Dockerfile copies named paths rather than `COPY . .`, so this is a
# second line of defence rather than the only one. Both exist because the
# first thing anyone does when a build fails is replace the explicit COPYs
# with `COPY . .`, and on that day this file is what stops a WhatsApp session
# or a .env from being baked into a layer.

# --- Credentials and session state: THE IMPORTANT PART --------------------
# `tools/loamy-whatsapp-poc/auth_info/` holds Baileys credentials -- noise
# keys, a signed identity key, 70 files including creds.json. Anyone with
# them can act as that WhatsApp account. They are already git-ignored by the
# proof of concept's own .gitignore; this keeps them out of Docker too, which
# .gitignore does not do.
tools/
tools/loamy-whatsapp-poc/auth_info/
**/auth_info/

# Local environment files. `.env` currently holds real Supabase and Paystack
# values. Image layers are readable by anyone who can pull the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.test.example

# Hugging Face / inference credentials, if any ever land here.
**/.huggingface/
**/token

# --- Large or irrelevant to the backend -----------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output: regenerated inside the image. Copying a host-built bundle
# would ship whatever was last compiled on a laptop.
dist
dist-server

# The Python speech-to-text environment: a virtualenv plus ~4.6 GiB of model
# weights. Nothing in the Node backend touches it.
.venv-stt
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Audio fixtures (several MB of WAV) and model artefacts.
scripts/stt-poc/audio/
**/*.wav
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin

# --- Development-only ------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github
tests
docs
public
supabase
playwright-report
test-results
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Frontend-only configuration. The backend bundle is built by
# scripts/build-server.mjs and reads none of these.
vite.config.ts
vitest.config.ts
vitest.security.config.ts
tailwind.config.js
tailwind.config.ts
postcss.config.js
index.html
vercel.json

# Container files themselves
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
fly.toml
